OL,3,GNEWSAOne man dead and two missing as
OL,4,Asearch goes on for fishing boat off
OL,5,ALewis
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say a body has been found in the
OL,8,Fsearch for three men who were onboard a
OL,9,Ffishing boat that has gone missing off
OL,10,Fthe Western Isles.
OL,12,FThe Maritime and Coastguard Agency
OL,13,F(MCA) said the alarm was raised at
OL,14,Fabout 21:20 on Tuesday when it emerged
OL,15,Fthe boat was overdue from Lewis.
OL,17,FIt said a plane and two helicopters
OL,18,Fwere making searches off the Port of
OL,19,FNess in north Lewis.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
